cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this evaluation suite or its archived runs, please cite the paper it
  was built for rather than this repository alone.
title: >-
  Evaluation suite and archived runs for "External-Function Access Reduced
  Crisis-Resource Inclusion in a Migraine-Care LLM Application"
abstract: >-
  The 87-case behaviour-first evaluation suite, the evaluated persona prompt and
  function schemas, the archived runs behind the numbers reported in the paper,
  and later independent Gemini replications that are verified separately and not
  pooled with the discovery archive. Retrieved corpus passages appear as their
  length only, for copyright reasons, and one in-house guidance document is
  pseudonymised. The model-run and gate results recompute from the recorded
  decisions; the annotation agreement ships in aggregate, because the
  annotators' per-item labels are held outside the repository.
